":"/audio/964cc4da6dafa7f41424.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71467","senseId":"1","lemma":"채우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"채워","audio":"/audio/c31f024bbb1d74476e02.mp3"}},{"text":"봐라.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐라","audio":"/audio/e5ea2e3c97b86f194395.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"8a8f066d91aa18af","term":"가득하다","zh":"满满","audio":"/audio/8a8f066d91aa18afc6b4.mp3","entryId":"62252","definition":"量或数最大限度地到达既定范围。","pronunciation":["가드카다"]},{"id":"964cc4da6dafa7f4","term":"채우다","zh":"倒满，装满，填满，加满","audio":"/audio/964cc4da6dafa7f41424.mp3","entryId":"71467","definition":"用某物将一定的空间占满，再也放不进去。","pronunciation":["채우다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d75768cdfacfa28527b6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62252","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3434,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊，那就倒满吧。","让我给您倒一杯酒吧。","妈妈，爷爷的家乡是哪里呀？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["让我给您倒一杯酒吧。","妈妈，爷爷的家乡是哪里呀？","好啊，那就倒满吧。"],"answer":2}]}
